{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag"],"title":"Tags","generated":true,"anchor":"Tags"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmncustomtag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNCustomTag","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the payload of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", one of the two untyped lanes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the tag model, and it is exactly the shape every tag had before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"model was typed: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound to nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is how GMN accommodates third-party extension: a name outside its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved vocabulary is not an error, but a custom tag that round-trips"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact and realizes as a no-op, ready for a consumer or a downstream tool"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to give it meaning."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"What lands here","anchor":"What-lands-here","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name outside GMN’s reserved vocabulary: "},{"code":"\\bembel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\\splitChord","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"\\shortFermata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\\chord","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and anything a consumer invents. Nothing reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what was written to such a tag, so there is no schema to bind against and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing to model. It round-trips byte for byte and realizes as a no-op."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"What does not land here","anchor":"What-does-not-land-here","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A reserved name that failed to promote is "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this. The distinction is enforced by "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which fails for a reserved name — so a "},{"code":"GMNCustomTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" never carries a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved name, at any stage, and the case cannot be used as a general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"escape hatch."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN does not reserve, carried in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its untyped, as-written form.